g\" width=\"17\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r90.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">y＝<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r91.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">x","k":["108年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910150","s":"如圖，將一張面積為　14　的大三角形紙片沿著虛線剪成三張小三角形紙片與一張平行四邊形紙片。根據圖中標示的長度，求平行四邊形紙片的面積為何？【108.會考】<br><img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_image13.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"253\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r93.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r94.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r95.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r96.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":3,"e":"作<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r97.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r98.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，則△AEF～△ABC（AA　相似）<br>三角形　ABC　面積＝<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r99.svg\" width=\"69\" alt=\"附圖\">＝14<br><img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r100.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r101.svg\" width=\"44\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4<br><img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r102.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r103.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r104.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r105.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r106.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：4＝3：7，<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r107.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r108.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r109.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4－<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r110.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r111.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">　∴平行四邊形紙片面積＝3×<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r112.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_r113.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/bd4002_y108_image14.png\" width=\"119\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["108年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910151","s":"圖(一)的摩天輪上以等間隔的方式設置　36　個車廂，車廂依順時針方向分別編號為　1　號到　36　號，且摩天輪運行時以逆時針方向等速旋轉，旋轉一圈花費　30　分鐘。若圖(二)表示　21　